---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Listening" description="What I've been listening to">
  <div class="listening-page">
    <section class="listening-hero">
      <p class="home-kicker">Digital garden</p>
      <h1>What I am listening to.</h1>
      <p>
        Music holds a very special place in my heart. It helps me focus, unwind, feel things properly, or get a little more energy when I need it.
      </p>
      <p>
        I am always looking for new music or podcasts, so recommendations are very welcome.
      </p>
      <div class="garden-hero-flower garden-hero-flower--herb" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="/images/flowers/pressed-herb.svg" alt="" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="listening-card-list" aria-label="Listening recommendations">
      <article class="listening-card listening-card--track">
        <div class="listening-card__embed">
          <iframe
            data-testid="embed-iframe-song"
            src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/track/6gqTgtJ3aBDrWE9wrCe7L6?utm_source=generator&theme=0"
            width="100%"
            height="152"
            class="spotify-widget"
            allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture"
            loading="lazy"
            title="Spotify embed for The Song of Orpheus by Ruari O'Connor"
          ></iframe>
        </div>

        <div class="listening-card__content">
          <p class="home-card__eyebrow">Currently obsessed with</p>
          <h2>The Song of Orpheus</h2>
          <p>
            I am currently obsessed with <em>The Song of Orpheus</em> by Ruari O'Connor. It draws from Greek mythology, is sung in Greek, and I cannot stop listening to it.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="listening-card listening-card--podcast">
        <div class="listening-card__content">
          <p class="home-card__eyebrow">If you need a laugh</p>
          <h2>Toni and Ryan</h2>
          <p>
            I have been an avid listener for years. They never cease to make me laugh, and it is a fantastic podcast when you need a proper uplift.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="listening-card__embed">
          <iframe
            data-testid="embed-iframe-podcast"
            src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/show/5OzkclFjD6iAjtAuo7aIYt?utm_source=generator&theme=0"
            width="100%"
            height="152"
            class="spotify-widget"
            allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture"
            loading="lazy"
            title="Spotify embed for Toni and Ryan podcast"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>


